  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Development Fund - Core Contribution for 2025-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK&apos;s contribution to the European Development Fund (EDF) payments in 2025-26. The EDF programme provides support to people in Africa, Caribbean and Pacific (ACP) countries. As agreed in the UK-EU Withdrawal Agreement (Articles 152-154), although the UK is no longer a member of the EU, the UK will continue to contribute to the EDF until the final EDF stream is closed. We make these payments three times a year.</narrative>
  </description>
